, "title": "Key outcomes of the 350th ESA Council meeting", "unwound_url": "https://www.esa.int/Newsroom/Press_Releases/Key_outcomes_of_the_350th_ESA_Council_meeting", "url": "https://t.co/WrLXM0ZQOg"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/diE49NDZk5", "end": 262, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/esa/status/2113289769668976839/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113289329514536962", "start": 239, "url": "https://t.co/diE49NDZk5"}]}, "id": "2113289769668976839", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 12997, "like_count": 105, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 19}, "text": "At its 350th meeting, our Council advanced key priorities for Europe in space, including the future of European space exploration, ESA–EU cooperation and preparations for upcoming Ministerial meetings. \n\nRead more: https://t.co/WrLXM0ZQOg https://t.co/diE49NDZk5", "url": "https://x.com/esa/status/2113289769668976839"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-22T14:43:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113280045921796497"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/ojblanchard1/s…", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/ojblanchard1/status/2113245243906634000", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/zPvhFgwOxQ"}]}, "id": "2113280045921796497", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 5820, "like_count": 182, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 14}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113245243906634000", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "how about this as a theory:\n\nrich people got rich by doing remarkable things with huge economic impacts\n\nthey observe that government spending has a rather low impact:dollar multiplier\n\nthey are people with massive drive to achieve high impact\n\nit offends them to hand over money https://t.co/zPvhFgwOxQ", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2113280045921796497"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-22T14:40:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113279424674328643"], "